#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0542 expect=violation domain=LB
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when the ECG Beat Number (--BEATNO) variable is present in a general-observation-class dataset other than the ECG Test Results (EG) domain. Per SDTM Model v2.0, --BEATNO is an Identifier allowed for all general observation classes but restricted to the EG domain ('EG Domain only').
#note "LBBEATNO column is present in LB, so the rule fires"
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1
dataset LB label="Laboratory Tests Results"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col LBSEQ type=Num label="Sequence Number"
col LBBEATNO type=Char label="Beat Number"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | LB | 01-701-1015 | 1 |
CDISCPILOT01 | LB | 01-701-1015 | 2 |
---
